convergence monitoring.

The real problem is multimodality if you don't have
the states associated with your observations.

> In my current model, developed from example code of rstan, the outcome probability density is incorrectly estimated at almost 50% probability and have problem in convergence as well.

See above.  Does it work if you run just one chain for a long time
(up to label ID, that is)?

