I don't think this is a good solution in general, because
you probably don't want to have such an ordering as part of
the model.

> Could anybody suggest a way to add appropriate constraints on the parameters? or to solve label switching problem?

There's not a good general solution here.  If the states
are highly separated you can reidentify with the posterior
by matching the estimates, but that won't help with multimodality.

